1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,780
If you feel like you're losing everything, remember.

2
00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:07,660
Trees lose their leaves every year, yet they still stand there,

3
00:00:08,320 --> 00:00:10,700
waiting quietly for better days to come.

4
00:00:11,460 --> 00:00:13,500
So if life feels empty right now,

5
00:00:14,100 --> 00:00:15,660
maybe you're just making space

6
00:00:16,320 --> 00:00:18,320
for something beautiful to grow again.
